@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/fhir

### Capacidades del servidor
GET {{baseUrl}}/metadata
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Datos que consulta el motor para Ana
GET {{baseUrl}}/Observation?subject=Patient/ana
Accept: application/fhir+json

### CQL almacenado (content.data contiene el texto en Base64)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Library/reglas-basicas
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Evaluar todas las expresiones para Ana
POST {{baseUrl}}/Library/reglas-basicas/$evaluate
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{"resourceType":"Parameters","parameter":[{"name":"subject","valueString":"Patient/ana"}]}

### Bruno es menor aunque tiene una observacion final
POST {{baseUrl}}/Library/reglas-basicas/$evaluate
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{"resourceType":"Parameters","parameter":[{"name":"subject","valueString":"Patient/bruno"}]}

### Carla es adulta pero su observacion es preliminar
POST {{baseUrl}}/Library/reglas-basicas/$evaluate
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{"resourceType":"Parameters","parameter":[{"name":"subject","valueString":"Patient/carla"}]}
